Modifications (Copyright (C) 2026 chrispil1337), among others:
- Ollama Cloud support with the API key in the macOS Keychain
- AI-cleaned transcript stored next to the untouched original, with
  word-level comparison and manual editing (new crate `app/mna-core`,
  `app/src/summary/transcript_cleanup.rs`, `app/src/db/cleaned.rs`)
- Import of audio files / voice memos as meetings (`app/src/import.rs`)
- German summaries
- Own name, bundle identifier, data folder and icon

